Third-party code in src/port/armv7m
===================================

This folder is for the Arm M profile with Thumb-2: Armv7-M and Armv7E-M
(Cortex-M3, M4, M7) and Armv8-M Mainline (Cortex-M33, M55, M85). It has no
ARM state, so the folders for A- and R-profile Arm don't serve it.

Five files below come from Apache NuttX and musl, copied byte for byte and
never edited. They keep their names and their notices. The other files are
libterae's own and carry libterae's notice: port_memcpy.S, port_memmove.S,
port_memset.S, port_aeabi_memcpy.S and port_aeabi_memset.S, which are the
files assembled; port_memcmp.c; libc.h, which stands in for NuttX's header
of that name; and port.mk, which gives the assembler option the Makefile
passes.

The three NuttX files carry the full text of their licences. musl's two
carry no notice, and musl's COPYRIGHT, reproduced at the end of this file,
puts such files under its MIT licence.


